        <h2 id="go-title" class="text-[clamp(28px,3.2vw,40px)] leading-[1.06] font-semibold tracking-[-0.035em]">Written in Go. Light on your server.</h2>
        <p class={body}>Plandillo is built almost entirely in Go. It starts fast, needs little memory and CPU, and runs comfortably on a small VPS or a home server, so it costs less to run and uses less energy.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

